      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ROCK IT ROGER (4) is in hot form winning his last four on end, the latest pinging the lids with a fast early split and clocking 22.25 over 395m at this track. Winner at his latest appearance in one of the quickest times on the card. Flying at the moment and expecting another big run. SUMMER FLING (2) was fourth on debut then claimed an impressive maiden win (29.83) by 9 lengths at Mt Gambier. Drawn the same box this time. Makes plenty of appeal on the back of that last-start win. TONY (7) scored well last start as odds-on favourite by 1.3 lengths at this track in a handy 22.39 beating Sokai. Outside box to overcome but goes well at this distance. Sure to be thereabouts. ZINFANDEL HOLY (8) was below best last time at Angle Park (31.24) in a Special conditions race, finishing a 12 length seventh. Has already won out of this draw.",
